; Deny io_uring operations for the blastwall automation domain.
; CVE-2026-43006 (zero-length fixed buffer OOB read) is the current
; open vulnerability; the subsystem has a long history of privilege
; escalation bugs.  Automation identities have no reason to use
; io_uring.
;
; Wrapped in an optional block so the rule is silently skipped on
; kernels that do not define the io_uring class (RHEL 7/8 and older
; kernels).  See policy/README.md for the optional-block convention.

(optional blastwall_io_uring_deny
  (deny blastwall_t self (io_uring (cmd override_creds sqpoll)))
  (neverallow blastwall_t self (io_uring (cmd override_creds sqpoll))))
